    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Welcome aboard!\nWe are proud to present a variety\nof exceptional menu selections\nfor your enjoyment.\nOur wine list includes selections\nchosen by Doug Frost, one of\nthree experts in the world to have\nearned both titles of Master\nSommelier and Master of Wine.\nThank you for choosing United.\nEnjoy!\nrevitalize\nDeparture\nsan francisco, usa\nArrival\nnarita, japan\nBusiness",
      "LÜAK\nx11-7\n*RS*.7#*\n*0. *11*\nR\u00262$K\n11251-A\n02522\n992717 NAte\n2600002-1 SFO-NAT LD83-S89E-L87\nExpress Dine\nFor your convenience, United is pleased to offer an expedited primary meal dining experience\nallowing you to make the most of your time onboard. You can choose to have your starter,\nsalad and entrée selection served all at once, followed by dessert.\nPlease note: The Washoku Zen meal is not available as an Express Dine option.\nbeginnings\nGrilled shrimp with mango and tomato relish 71\nover a bed of seasonal mixed greens\nCreamy Garlic or Balsamic Vinaigrette\nIf you have chosen the Washoku Zen meal, the appetizer selection is served as the starter\nmain course\nFilet mignon with herbed compound butter 7\nGarlic red skin mashed potatoes and grilled asparagus\nSaté spiced chicken\nVegetarian risotto and herbed asparagus, carrot sauté\nWashoku Zen selection*\nAppetizers of layered egg, salmon temari,\nA main course of pan-seared monkfish\nburdock wrapped in glazed beef,\nwith nanban an, simmered daikon,\nshrimp with fish eggs, seared tuna\noyster mushrooms and sautéed vegetables,\nwith wasabi dressing, somen noodles\nserved with steamed rice\nand simmered shiitake mushroom\nand Japanese pickled vegetables\nServed with green tea\nSteamed rice available upon request\nto finish\nArtisan cheese selection\nServed with red grapes and crackers\nSan Joaquin Gold, Le Cabrie\nIce cream\nmidflight snack\nBoar's Head® roast beef sandwich\nCheddar cheese and horseradish spread on multi-grain bread\nFresh tomato, mozzarella and basil caprese sandwich\nBasil aïoli on a ciabatta roll\nFresh fruit All natural pop chips®\nEmerald® Cocoa Roast™ Almonds\nToblerone chocolate bar\nHot noodles are available upon request\nPlease help yourself to assorted sandwiches and snacks located near the galley\nprior to arrival\nChicken and shrimp jambalaya\nBasmati rice\nFresh seasonal fruit plate\nCreamy yogurt\n*Items in this meal may contain MSG.\nWe apologize if your meal selection\nis not available.\nYou may pre-order the Washoku\nZen Japanese meal on future flights\nbetween the United States and\nJapan. Pre-orders may be arranged\nthrough United.com or by\ncontacting United Reservations\nor your travel professional at least\n24 hours prior to departure.\n\" United Airlines\nExecutive Chef Selection.\nWelcome aboard!\nWe are proud to present a variety\nof exceptional menu selections\nfor your enjoyment.\nOur wine list includes selections\nchosen by Doug Frost, one of\nthree experts in the world to have\nearned both titles of Master\nSommelier and Master of Wine.\nThank you for choosing United.\nEnjoy!\nDeparture\nsan francisco, usa\nArrival\nnarita, japan"
    ],
